{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/extras/RoadMap_EN.png?t=1745075096\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing real-time idle village-building simulator nestled in the corner of your screen! Build, Craft, and Trade to guide your village from humble beginnings to a thriving trading hub, it's time to write your own Village Tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/extras/DesktopGIF.gif?t=1745075096\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build and Expand Your Village:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct buildings and decorations, unlock new industries, and grow your population into a thriving, happy community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/extras/Expand_Village_GIF.gif?t=1745075096\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trade and Build Relationships:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accept trade requests from neighboring villages, fulfill their orders to boost your village\u2019s economy and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/extras/Trade_Village_GIF.gif?t=1745075096\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Everything:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize your village with a variety of customization options, from unique building designs to villagers appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/extras/Custumize_Village_GIF.gif?t=1745075096\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relaxed and Accessible Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Village Tale seamlessly fits into your life with idle mechanics that let your village grow even when you\u2019re not actively playing. Always visible on your screen, it\u2019s easy to check in and make decisions whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Take a break, settle in, and create the village of your dreams.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd5b Real-time Gameplay that flows continuously like an ant farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd28 Expand and customize your village infinitely for tens of hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Optimize your building placement for better production and trading</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude0a Raise the happiness of your population and create the best village in the region </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Set on quietly your Desktop while you go about your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2764\ufe0f Establish and enhance relationships and trading routes with other regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/extras/Full_Village_Gif.gif?t=1745075096\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447510?t=1745075096","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745075096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/f7ac1cb641d7c0b12ef1ad98c3e24fe210e242d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745075096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447510/f7ac1cb641d7c0b12ef1ad98c3e24fe210e242d4/capsule_184x69.